# iRules namespace highlight assertions sourced from F5 iRules docs.
# Keep annotation-shaped text out of the prose comments here: in ANY
# comment the highlight-test runner treats an assertion marker (a caret,
# or a less-than plus hyphen) followed by a capture-name-shaped token as
# an assertion against the preceding line. Writing the namespace match
# pattern out literally in a comment fails the suite (#32).

